# Orion-X Phoenix Edition — canonical /etc/hosts (DEC-PHASE11-022)
#
# Shipped in includes.chroot so live-build's chroot_hosts remove restores THIS
# file into the image deterministically. Without it, the restore falls back to
# the .orig saved at build start — and across interrupted/resumed builds that
# leaked the BUILD CONTAINER's hosts file into the shipped ISO (a Docker
# bridge-network container entry was observed on real hardware, 2026-08-23).
# NB: do not quote literal leak signatures in this comment — assertion 34n
# greps this file for them.
# The first-boot wizard appends the runtime "127.0.1.1 <generated-name>" line.
127.0.0.1	localhost localhost.localdomain orionx
::1		localhost ip6-localhost ip6-loopback
fe00::0		ip6-localnet
ff00::0		ip6-mcastprefix
ff02::1		ip6-allnodes
ff02::2		ip6-allrouters
